{
  "corpus_id": "type-bridge.diagnostic-json",
  "version": 1,
  "description": "The JSON forms in which a structured diagnostic reaches a host. form sdk is SdkDiagnosticJson (contract sdk_diagnostic.rs): version, category (query category when present, else SDK category), sdk_category, query_category, code, message, path, details; count, byte_count, and signed details are decimal strings, path positions are numbers. form contract is the serde form of contract Diagnostic: category, code, message, path, details; long details are decimal strings. Each producer emits the diagnostic byte-for-byte equal as JSON: Python as its exception attributes, Node as the native error message, C through type_bridge_diagnostics_json.",
